celata (0.9.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The state of the connection in colour, an icon with a menu in the system
    tray and optional desktop notifications.
  * Locations by country, favorite locations and an automatic "Best
    location".
  * Light and dark appearance.
  * Celata starts the hide.me service itself (rule for polkit in the package).
  * Optional check for new versions (off by default).
  * Setup script and Linux Mint 22 as a tested system.

